# The audio scene, which F7 in mygame cycles to (see docs/audio/design.md#the-sample): a hum that moves from side to side
# behind a wall, in earshot of a listener on the camera, over a long sound that streams. The wall muffles the hum while
# it is between the two, and the hum moves across the stereo image as it goes. Positions are raw World_Position values in
# units of 2^-24 m. The editor writes this file; see docs/editor/document-and-scenes.md#scenes.
